<title>TAIWAN: Evergreen Marine 1996 six-mth profits up.</title>
<headline>Evergreen Marine 1996 six-mth profits up.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six-month results to June 30.</p>
<p>			 (In millions of T$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover				 15,813  vs   14,603</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			  2,268  vs    1,836</p>
<p>    Net profit				1,734  vs    1,467</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (in single T$)  1.11  vs     1.16</p>
<p>NOTE - Evergreen Marine Corp (Taiwan) Ltd is one of the world's largest container shipping firms.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
